      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLASHLIGHT (1) looks hard to beat. He was impressive winning his maiden hurdle on debut here two back before a tough effort at Coleraine with 71kg, sent out $2.35 and just missing. Finds a nice race here and can improve again, go close. UNTETHERED (3) has had five starts over the jumps but broke through for an impressive maiden hurdle win at Hamilton last time out, scoring by nearly four lengths. He'll roll along and take catching. SAINT EUSTACE (2) switches back to the hurdles after some solid form steeplechasing. He's certainly a capable jumper who will stay this strongly. ZEDWILLDO (5) hasn't fired in two jumps races to date but is next best from HULA BEAT (4) who rounds out the five.",
